  "question": {
    "text": "The colour of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> is due to: [where <math> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext><mo>→</mo></mrow> </math> metal, <math> <mrow> <mtext>L</mtext><mo>→</mo></mrow> </math> ligand]"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mi>&#x03C3;</mi><mo>&#x2212;</mo><msup>   <mi>&#x03C3;</mi>   <mtext>*</mtext>  </msup>  </mrow></math> transition",
      "is_correct": false
